---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy at Niyora" description="No data leaves this device. We don't run servers. We don't have accounts.">
  <div class="container">
    <a class="back" href="/">← Back to Niyora</a>
    <h1>Privacy at Niyora</h1>

    <div class="promise">
      <p class="promise-text">No data leaves this device. We don't run servers. We don't have accounts.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>What stays on your device</h2>
    <p>Everything. Session history, technique preferences, reminder schedule, HRV data when paired, tier progression. All of it lives in your app container and never leaves your device.</p>

    <h2>What never crosses the wire</h2>
    <p>No telemetry. No analytics. No crash reporting. No opt-in upsell. The app makes zero outbound network requests of its own.</p>

    <h2>Local pairing</h2>
    <p>When your iPhone pairs with your Mac, the only network calls are Bonjour discovery and a direct TCP connection on the same Wi-Fi. No traffic leaves the LAN.</p>

    <h2>App Store privacy nutrition label</h2>
    <p>Data Not Collected. When iOS v1 ships, you'll see the full label on the App Store page.</p>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>Contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@niyora.com">privacy@niyora.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  body { background: #0a0814; }
  .container {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 24px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }
  a.back {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  a.back:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }
  h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .promise {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    padding: 28px;
    background: rgba(20, 18, 32, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .promise-text {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    margin: 0;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    margin: 32px 0 12px;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  a {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  a:hover {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
  }
</style>
